      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Whittier-Los_Nietos%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before Spanish and Mexican land grants, the area was part of Tongva Native American territory, shaping its early history.",
